title: WidgetExamples

! `<$mermaid>` Widget Examples

!! 1. Direct Attribute Usage

```html
<$mermaid text="flowchart LR; A[Left] --> B[Center] --> C[Right];"/>
```

<$mermaid text="flowchart LR; A[Left] --> B[Center] --> C[Right];"/>

!! 2. Inline Widget Body

```html
<$mermaid>
flowchart TD
    Alpha[Alpha Node] --> Beta[Beta Node]
    Beta --> Gamma[Gamma Node]
</$mermaid>
```

<$mermaid>
flowchart TD
    Alpha[Alpha Node] --> Beta[Beta Node]
    Beta --> Gamma[Gamma Node]
</$mermaid>

!! 3. Alignment

!!! Left Aligned

```html
<$mermaid align="left" text="graph LR; A-->B;"/>
```

<$mermaid align="left" text="graph LR; A-->B;"/>

!!! Right Aligned

```html
<$mermaid align="right" text="graph LR; X-->Y;"/>
```

<$mermaid align="right" text="graph LR; X-->Y;"/>

!! 4. Explicit Theme Override & Legibility Themes

!!! High Contrast Theme (`theme="high-contrast"`)

Enforces WCAG AAA compliance (contrast ratio >= 7:1) with high-visibility borders, fills, and text.

```html
<$mermaid theme="high-contrast" text="graph TD
    A[Ultra Crisp Node] --> B{High Contrast Decision}
    B -->|Verified| C[Readable Result]
    B -->|Failed| D[Flagged Alert]
"/>
```

<$mermaid theme="high-contrast" text="graph TD
    A[Ultra Crisp Node] --> B{High Contrast Decision}
    B -->|Verified| C[Readable Result]
    B -->|Failed| D[Flagged Alert]
"/>

!!! Technical / Blueprint Theme (`theme="technical"`)

Clean engineering blueprint styling with deep slate nodes and high-visibility cyan accents.

```html
<$mermaid theme="technical" text="flowchart LR
    Client[Web Client] --> Gateway[API Gateway]
    Gateway --> Auth[Auth Service]
    Gateway --> DB[(PostgreSQL)]
"/>
```

<$mermaid theme="technical" text="flowchart LR
    Client[Web Client] --> Gateway[API Gateway]
    Gateway --> Auth[Auth Service]
    Gateway --> DB[(PostgreSQL)]
"/>

!!! Monochrome Theme (`theme="monochrome"`)

Clean publication grayscale with solid high-contrast edges and text, ideal for printing and export.

```html
<$mermaid theme="monochrome" text="graph LR
    Plan[Plan] --> Execute[Execute] --> Review[Review] --> Ship[Ship]
"/>
```

<$mermaid theme="monochrome" text="graph LR
    Plan[Plan] --> Execute[Execute] --> Review[Review] --> Ship[Ship]
"/>

!!! Forest Theme (`theme="forest"`)

```html
<$mermaid theme="forest" text="pie title Languages Used
    'JavaScript' : 55
    'WikiText' : 30
    'CSS' : 15
"/>
```

<$mermaid theme="forest" text="pie title Languages Used
